Herrn Grunendahl, Lehrer an der                         Nicolai-Schule<lb/>
in Hamburg.</p>                     <lb/>
<closer><signed><hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#fr">J. E. Kru&#x017F;ens                         Erben.</hi></hi></signed></closer>                 </div>                 <lb/>
